  <item>
    <title>时间旅行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ec19ed1d989496e77401ff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ec19ed1d989496e77401ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 01:42:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从前玩乐的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>好朋友把我们一个个送回家的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家吵吵闹闹在车里抢蓝牙当DJ</span></p><span></span><p><span>某些雨夜</span></p><span></span><p><span>总喜欢听HONNE</span></p><span></span><p><span>这感觉就在昨天</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么就突然十年重制版了呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>过了某一个节点</span></p><span></span><p><span>时空扭曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>开始十年十年过了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近常常在海边</span></p><span></span><p><span>码头整点薯条</span></p><span></span><p><span>都说幸福的人静悄悄</span></p><span></span><p><span>这话一点不假</span></p><span></span><p><span>偶尔打开大家发来的工作文件</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容磅礴到吓自己一跳</span></p><span></span><p><span>余华老师看到莫言老师作品时的反应</span></p><span></span><p><span>也果然不假</span></p><span></span><p><span>📃</span></p><span></span><p><span>开始了一个实验性质的小尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span>「 当剥离流量 标签</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些所有世俗标准和眼光</span></p><span></span><p><span>完完全全的诚实表达</span></p><span></span><p><span>如同在无人知晓的深海里</span></p><span></span><p><span>持续不断发出微弱信号</span></p><span></span><p><span>它会走向何方</span></p><span></span><p><span>它还算存在吗」</span></p><span></span><p><span>📶</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期曲目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>HONNE - Warm on a Cold Night</span></p><span></span><p><span>Richard Houghten - Water My Soul</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ardhito Pramono - 17 To 70</span></p><span></span><p><span>Durand Jones &amp; The Indications,Aaron Frazer - Flower Moon</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nerd Connection - 좋은 밤 좋은 꿈</span></p><span></span><p><span>wave to earth - bad</span></p><span></span><p><span>BLU-SWING - Sum</span></p><span></span><p><span>HONNE - Warm on a Cold Night (10 Years)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqI5-AgP1K9R9lCMAGBEI7Dr3MuQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6tyXftfi5bYDdVdWHwolUr1ZTV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>♥ 所有音乐作品版权归其各自所有者。</span></em></p>]]></description>
