    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果</span></p><span></span><p><span>像照顾一个真正关心的人那样照顾自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会为她/他规划怎样的道路</span></p><span></span><p><span>会和现在不同吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>你如何和这个时代对话</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何回应它提出的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>不用回答</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span>认真生活的每一天</span></p><span></span><p><span>都会越来越好的</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年也能赶上大家的跨年焰火</span></p><span></span><p><span>新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期曲目</span></p><span></span><p><span>Queen - Don't Stop Me Now</span></p><span></span><p><span>Splize - Believe in Me</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pomplamoose - Jamirobeegees Mashup Stayin' Alive &nbsp;Virtual Insanity</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jonathan Groff,Original Broadway Cast of Hamilton - You'll Be Back</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gipsy Kings - A Mi Manera (Comme d'habitude)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Willie Nelson - Crazy</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tony Bennett - For Once in My Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cassandra Jenkins - Hard Drive</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chet Baker - Little Girl Blue (Instrumental Version)</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>♥ 所有音乐作品版权归其各自所有者。</span></em></p>]]></description>
