  <item>
    <title>碎碎念</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c3b737a56ca3e0c408b1e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c3b737a56ca3e0c408b1e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Sep 2025 06:12:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生中有过几次醉氧</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次终于幕天席地在森林里睡了一觉</span></p><span></span><p><span>短短的半个小时里</span></p><span></span><p><span>感觉自己一会儿变成了一棵树</span></p><span></span><p><span>一会儿又变成一缕风</span></p><span></span><p><span>所有烦恼 都离我远了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpviIbLEwveNMvuJ-CjqAKWyIOXu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>对于追求自由的人来说</span></p><span></span><p><span>遇到更多波折 多于常人的心碎时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>那是再正常不过的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的生命由一连串的随机事件组成</span></p><span></span><p><span>越早和不确定性起舞</span></p><span></span><p><span>越早获得真正的自由</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln__XgfhKxKhhfaxNAYvL25ytqC1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「Hype」</span></p><span></span><p><span>学习时听到一段充满智慧的话</span></p><span></span><p><span>原句是对人工智能的评价</span></p><span></span><p><span>技术专家指出</span></p><span></span><p><span>人们对新技术的常见误解</span></p><span></span><p><span>要么过于乐观 觉得它像魔术师无所不能</span></p><span></span><p><span>要么过于悲观 觉得机器人总有一天要对人类发起总攻</span></p><span></span><p><span>但只要细心学习 懂得它的运行逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>就会发现它的局限</span></p><span></span><p><span>也会赞叹它对未来世界产生的巨大影响和变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤖️</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想 种种「求真」 &nbsp;都来源于此</span></p><span></span><p><span>指引我们 去一探究竟</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>To see the world, things dangerous to come to,</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>to see behind walls, to draw closer,</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>to find each other and to feel.</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq4AZPg1Wh0u1N5gm7BScs1mUVwT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liG6af8RgjrFme9eobLWJrm6IZWI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/li7FLfudiBCIW4TFX_qyVbupZXNo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期曲目</span></p><span></span><p><span>Joji - Glimpse of Us</span></p><span></span><p><span>莫文蔚 - 寂寞的恋人啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>Smerz - Roll the dice</span></p><span></span><p><span>FKJ - Moments (Part 2)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Willie Nelson - It Always Will Be</span></p><span></span><p><span>武満徹 - The Last Waltz</span></p><span></span><p><span>Olivia Dean - Float</span></p><span></span><p><span>Justin Hurwitz - Fletcher's Song In Club</span></p><span></span><p><span>Agnes Obel - September Song</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天快乐🍁</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>♥ 所有音乐作品版权归其各自所有者。</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6219c1f142107d36fefdfa6c/ltFiSEiYSzUkKeB4-nRA8EOgI45a.m4a" length="27737579" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkFpAv-3u4Ivb-Bt5m-rMHKncd0E.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
